=== PART B: fragmentation vs condensed inventory (n_target = 120) ===
oo_scale multiplies the 5-5 / 4-O-5 channel, the ONLY welder. Lowering it
makes fragments -- at the cost of the condensed inventory it is calibrated to.
-- softwood (S/G 0.0) --  ref 5-5 = 6.0, ref 4-O-5 = 1.5 --
